# The plural year noun that frames a decade ("ls anhos 80"); the singular
# "anho" names a single year and must not reach the decade slot.
# Sources: Wiktionary, s.v. "anho" (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/anho),
# Mirandese noun: "anho m (plural anhos)"; and the decade surface in
# running text on the Biquipedia -- "nun eirie para alhá de ls anhos 80 de
# l seclo XX" (mwl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lhéngua_mirandesa).
anhos
